			<title>To be clear: their business model is not feasible everyone knows, but the reality that will force that truth to match the market...</title>
			<link>https://www.facebook.com/reel/1635706841620765/</link>
			<description>To be clear: their business model is not feasible everyone knows, but the reality that will force that truth to match the markets is when there is a marketable alternative - and that is precisely what Chinese technology presents. It is not a matter of Chinese technology making the business model unfeasible. It is a matter of proving that it is unfeasible.&lt;br&gt;
