		<item>
			<guid isPermaLink="false">277755958764636_122235170234352810</guid>
			<title>Why are you thanking them for their service if you think they are victims of the system they served?</title>
			<link>https://www.facebook.com/reel/2035130081224892/</link>
			<description>Why are you thanking them for their service if you think they are victims of the system they served? Because you don’t largely that is an excuse to whitewash the crimes that the American military instrumentalised them to commit and the role they had in re-creating that system. We don’t say this about any other terror org from the IDF to RSF, so don’t say it about the DOD.&lt;br&gt;
